Cell["\<\
FINDER

The QNM is estimated searching the root of the integrator\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
output.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999074491797516*^9, 3.9990744947447987`*^9}, {
  3.999074809608803*^9, 
